{"id":43537,"date":"2025-07-23T15:36:23","date_gmt":"2025-07-23T14:36:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vodafone-10k-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-08-21T00:01:57","modified_gmt":"2026-08-20T23:01:57","slug":"vodafone-10k-2026","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vodafone-10k-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Vodafone 10k 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"pr-expired-notice\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex: 1; min-width: 260px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<\/span><div><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\">Esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o j\u00e1 decorreu.<\/strong><p style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #CBD5E1; margin: 2px 0 0 0;\">Consulta os resultados desta prova abaixo ou acede a todos os detalhes da edi\u00e7\u00e3o atual.<\/p><\/div><\/div><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vodafone-10k\/\" style=\"background: #8B5CF6 !important; color: #FFFFFF !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 13.5px !important; text-decoration: none !important; padding: 11px 22px !important; border-radius: 10px !important; white-space: nowrap !important; display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: center !important; height: 42px !important; margin: 0 !important; border: none !important; line-height: 1 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4) !important;\">Ver Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Atual &rarr;<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A <strong>Vodafone 10K 2026<\/strong> realiza-se em <strong>Lisboa, Portugal<\/strong>, no dia <strong>8 de mar\u00e7o de 2026<\/strong>. Trata-se de uma prova de <strong>estrada<\/strong> com a dist\u00e2ncia \u00fanica de <strong>10 km<\/strong>, integrada no evento da prestigiada EDP Meia Maratona de Lisboa. Realizada anualmente em <strong>mar\u00e7o<\/strong>, a corrida destaca-se pelo seu &#8220;selling point&#8221; incompar\u00e1vel: a oportunidade de atravessar a p\u00e9 a ic\u00f3nica <strong>Ponte 25 de Abril<\/strong>, com partida na pra\u00e7a da portagem e uma chegada monumental em Bel\u00e9m, em frente ao Mosteiro dos Jer\u00f3nimos. \u00c9 reconhecida por ser uma prova r\u00e1pida, inclusiva e com uma atmosfera festiva que atrai milhares de participantes nacionais e internacionais.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":43538,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-43537","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lisboa","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Vodafone-10k-2026-1-1024x485.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/43537","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=43537"}],"version-his